title: Europe's Radical Right Shares a Stage
subtitle: Respond once to the European radical-right breakthrough already on the record.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_foreign_card
frequency: 80
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_european_right_shock_done = 1 and not poland_european_right_response_done
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_european_right_response_done = 1; foreign_cards_resolved += 1
card-image: img/poland/cards/national-left-rally.webp

= Europe's radical right shares a stage

Election victories and coalition breakthroughs abroad have already delivered
networks and momentum through a mandatory dated event. Polish radical-right
media now presents climate obstruction, migration panic and Ukraine fatigue
as the future rather than one contested European current. This card chooses a
one-shot response; it does not manufacture those victories by being played.

- @social
- @firewall
- @imitate

@social
title: Build a cross-border social answer to the grievance coalition
subtitle: Labour credibility +5, European-left network +5 and far-right agenda −2.
on-arrival: labor_credibility += 5; eu_left_network += 5; workers_support += 3; household_security += 2; far_right_agenda -= 2; fiscal_stress += 2; news_headline = "The Left answers Europe's radical right with wages and security"

The campaign challenges the right on the material conditions it exploits
without pretending racism and authoritarianism are merely misunderstandings.

- #poland_card_finish

@firewall
title: Form a democratic European firewall with liberals and conservatives
subtitle: EU trust +4 and KO relations +4; Left unity −2.
on-arrival: eu_institutional_trust += 4; eu_influence += 3; ko_relation += 4; p2050_relation += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; party_unity -= 2; razem_dissent += 3; news_headline = "A democratic firewall contains the right and blurs the Left"

The coalition can block appointments and procedural capture. Its common
programme ends exactly where wages, migration and economic power begin.

- #poland_card_finish

@imitate
title: Harden the migration and climate line before the right owns it
subtitle: Border confidence +4; refugee empathy −4 and far-right agenda +5.
on-arrival: border_security_confidence += 4; refugee_empathy -= 4; minority_safety -= 3; climate_state_capacity -= 3; far_right_agenda += 5; konf_poll_momentum += 0.4; democratic_rightward_pressure += 4; news_headline = "The centre-left imports the radical right's European lesson"

The move receives a day of approving coverage from commentators who spend the
next day crediting the original.

- #poland_card_finish
